        <p>The response also carries the raw database fields the four objects above are built from, along with our internal search indexes. These are not documented, are subject to change, and only the four objects shown above are intended for use.</p>
        <p>If you request a kanji character for which <em>Kanji Alive</em> does not have data you will get an error response:</p>
        <pre>
{
  "error": "No kanji found."
}</pre>
